WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:25.503
"This snow is deep," said Poppy.

2
00:00:25.504 --> 00:00:28.695
"I can't drive in it!"

3
00:00:28.696 --> 00:00:32.463
"I can't drive either," said Dipper.

4
00:00:32.464 --> 00:00:47.330
"I'm stuck!"

5
00:00:47.331 --> 00:00:51.426
Jeb drove through the snow.

6
00:00:51.427 --> 00:00:59.469
"I can drive in it," he said.

7
00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:03.714
Wind blew.

8
00:01:03.715 --> 00:01:10.057
It made big snow piles.

9
00:01:10.058 --> 00:01:14.834
The snow piles blocked the road.

10
00:01:14.835 --> 00:01:18.459
"Uh-oh," said Jeb.

11
00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.422
"We can't get to the road."

12
00:01:21.423 --> 00:01:27.669
"We're stuck at school!" said Eddy.

13
00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:32.718
Mr. Grill went into the garage.

14
00:01:32.719 --> 00:01:40.427
He came out with a snowplow.

15
00:01:40.428 --> 00:01:54.576
His snowplow pushed the snow.

16
00:01:54.577 --> 00:01:58.146
Soon the parking lot was clear.

17
00:01:58.147 --> 00:02:06.918
"We can move now!" said Poppy.

18
00:02:06.919 --> 00:02:12.197
Mr. Grill pushed the snow piles.

19
00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:16.092
But the piles were too big.

20
00:02:16.093 --> 00:02:19.185
Snap!

21
00:02:19.186 --> 00:02:22.960
"Ugh!" said Mr. Grill.

22
00:02:22.961 --> 00:02:27.305
"My snowplow broke!"
